# Coding-agent configuration

The operator retired the historical mandatory routing and per-turn procedure rules on September 10, 2026. Use judgment about direct work and delegation within the requested scope.

Shared working and delivery preferences: `~/.agents/shared/PREFERENCES.md`. Machine registry: `~/.agents/shared/MACHINES.md`.

Existing launcher, provider, authentication, permission and model-cost settings remain in force. Do not infer a new model route or bypass a guard from this document. Agent definitions describe available specialist capabilities, not a required itinerary. Preserve an actual job/thread identifier for background work and report its observed outcome.

